# Drama Radar — optional configuration
#
# The app runs with NONE of these set (demo mode: a bundled curated batch).
# Add any ONE key to enable live scraping + AI curation.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in, or set these in the Vercel dashboard
# (Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables).

# --- Pick one provider ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Optional overrides ---
# DRAMA_RADAR_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# PORT=8787
# API_TARGET=http://localhost:8787
